    "title": "Rex take down Bombers, 9-4 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "TERRE HAUTE, Ind. (WTWO/WAWV) — The Terre Haute Rex defeated the Dubois County Bombers, 9-4 at Bob Warn Field. Pitcher Kaleb Marrs picked up the win on the mound, striking out four batters across five innings. Catcher Nick Turner drove in two runs to lead the way for the Rex. The Rex will be back in action at home against the Champion City Kings on July 24th. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to MyWabashValley.com.",
